/** \defgroup BASE Base
 *  \ingroup CORE
    \brief Basic structures used by other CivilCvCAD components

    The Base module includes most of the basic functions of CivilCvCAD, such as:
    - Console services: printing different kinds of messages to the CivilCvCAD report view or the terminal
    - Python interpreter: handles the execution of Python code in CivilCvCAD
    - Parameter handling: Management, saving and restoring of user preferences settings
    - Units: Management and conversion of different units

*/

